gruvoc: Unstructured volume mesh interface from CAPE team

Convert, move, or analyze unstructured meshes with tets,
pyramids, prisms, and/or hexs.

USAGE

    $ gruvoc CMD [ARGS] [OPTIONS]

SUB-COMMANDS

    help
        Display help message and exit

    convert
        Convert mesh from one format to another

    print
        Print summary of a surface or volume mesh

    report
        Print summary of a surface or volume mesh

    report-small-vols
        Report cells with smallest volumes

    small-vols
        Report cells with smallest volumes

OPTIONS

    --help
        Print this help message and exit
